# Cursor Rules Template

# 1. First-Pass Context
Always consult `AGENTS.md` and `ARCHITECTURE.md` before reading code files.
Read only relevant line ranges; do not load entire 500+ line files into context.

# 2. Strict Invariants
- Never commit secrets, private tokens, or hardcoded server URLs.
- Always run the relevant test suite before completing turns.
- Preserve existing comments, types, and architecture conventions.
